factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 6 problems
  The slide line 'தப்பிய கைதி குறித்த கூடுதல் விவரம் வெளியிடப்படவில்லை' (no further details about the escaped prisoner were released) is not stated in the article.
  The reel_script and caption say Udhayanidhi asked whether the next escape would be from 'Palayamkottai or Salem' prison, and the slide adds 'சிறையா'; the article only asks 'பாளையம்கோட்டையா? சேலமா?' without specifying prisons, so 'சிறை' is an added detail (minor).
  The reel_script and caption describe the Chief Minister as having 'ஆட்சி நிலை' and the slide says 'ஆட்சி உள்ளதாக' – the article's sense is that the ruling 'Dummy Chief Minister's' governance is so poor that prisoners escape; the draft's phrasing 'ஆட்சி நிலை' is vague and does not clearly convey this meaning.
  The reel_script says 'கைதிகள் தப்பிச் செல்லும் அளவுக்கு ஆட்சி நிலை இருப்பதாக' and the slide line 'சிறைக் கைதிகள் தப்பிச் செல்லும் அளவுக்கு ஆட்சி உள்ளதாக அவர்' is ungrammatically broken and loses the sarcastic 'Dummy முதலமைச்சர்' criticism, which the article makes central.
  The article's 'தேனி' escape is described as 'புழல், தேனியைத் தொடர்ந்து' – the reel_script correctly mentions it, but the article does not state the Coimbatore escapee was the sole or only prisoner; the 'ஒரு கைதி' count is consistent, so no issue there.
  The reel_script omits the article's accusation that the government is a 'கையாலாகாத அரசு' and that prisoners are fleeing knowing it, an important point of the critique, though this is a lesser omission.
