  The slides_spec line 'இதுவரை அதிகாரபூர்வ நடவடிக்கை குறித்த விவரம்' (official action details so far) is an invented claim; the article contains no such information about official action being unavailable.
  The reel_script states that the prisoner escape was 'the' event, but the article does not say the prisoner was caught or not; the draft's slide heading 'பணியிடமாற்றம்?' and the line about the chief minister being the one to transfer/suspend is a paraphrase that changes the sarcastic claim, which is acceptable, but the slides line 'முதலமைச்சரே' is fine. The main unsupported addition is the 'official action' line noted above.
