factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 7 problems
  The article says the escaped inmate was from Coimbatore Central Prison, but the draft's slides_spec 'loc' and the headline hashtag context are consistent; however, the reel_script and slides omit that the article raises the question of Pallayamkottai or Salem as possible next escapes, which is part of the criticism.
  The article says Udhayanidhi said the Chief Minister is running to by-election constituencies out of fear of defeat; the draft says the CM 'goes to' by-election constituencies, which is consistent, but the slide line 'தோல்வி பயத்தில் முதலமைச்சர் இடைத்தேர்தல்' is an incomplete, ungrammatical sentence with no clear meaning in Tamil.
  The slide line 'கைதிகள் தப்பிச் செல்லும் அளவுக்கு ஆட்சி லட்சணம் உள்ளது' drops the 'Dummy' Chief Minister reference and reads as a general statement about the government rather than the article's specific criticism of the Chief Minister's rule.
  The slide line 'இனி பணியிட மாற்றம், சஸ்பெண்ட் செய்தால் முதலமைச்சரே' is an incomplete sentence with no clear meaning; the predicate (செய்துகொள்ள வேண்டும்) is missing.
  The caption says the Chief Minister's rule 'உள்ளதாக' is criticised in a way that leaves the object of the sentence ambiguous: 'முதலமைச்சரின் ஆட்சி' is cut off mid-thought in the caption ('கைதிகள் தப்பிச் செல்லும் அளவுக்கு முதலமைச்சரின் ஆட்சி உள்ளதாக') which mixes the escape claim with a separate claim, creating an unclear sentence.
  The reel_script omits the article's note that the prisoners themselves recognised the government as ineffective ('இது கையாலாகாத அரசு என தெரிந்து கொண்டு'), a key rhetorical point of the criticism.
  The slides 'hl2' headline 'உதயநிதி கடும் விமர்சனம்' and the first slide title 'உதயநிதியின்' is a truncated title with no noun, which is not a clear Tamil phrase.
